---
const x = (p: number) => 34 + ((p - 1) / 63) * 228;
const y = (s: number) => 202 - s * 18;
const curve = Array.from({ length: 64 }, (_, i) => {
  const p = i + 1;
  return `${x(p).toFixed(2)},${y(1 / (0.1 + 0.9 / p)).toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 280 252"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Speedup ideal de Amdahl para fração serial 0,1, com um a 64 núcleos. A curva aproxima-se do teto 10 sem o atingir."
  >
    <path d="M34 22 V202 H262" fill="none" stroke="var(--text)" />
    {[0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10].map((s) => (
      <g>
        <line x1="34" x2="262" y1={y(s)} y2={y(s)} stroke="var(--line)" />
        <text x="27" y={y(s) + 5} text-anchor="end">
          {s}
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    {[1, 16, 32, 48, 64].map((p) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={x(p)} x2={x(p)} y1="202" y2="207" stroke="var(--text)" />
        <text x={x(p)} y="224" text-anchor="middle">
          {p}
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line
      x1="34"
      x2="262"
      y1="22"
      y2="22"
      stroke="var(--text)"
      stroke-dasharray="5 4"
      stroke-width="2"
    />
    <polyline
      points={curve}
      fill="none"
      stroke="var(--accent)"
      stroke-width="2.5"
    />
    <circle cx={x(1)} cy={y(1)} r="3" fill="var(--accent)" />
    <text x="8" y="15">
      Sₚ
    </text>
    <text x="148" y="242" text-anchor="middle">
      p, núcleos
    </text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Curva contínua: ganho previsto com f = 0,1. Linha tracejada: teto 1/f = 10.
    Um núcleo dá ganho 1; aumentar p aproxima a curva do teto.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    height: auto;
    margin-inline: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--text);
    font: 14px sans-serif;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
</style>
